        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Currently available knowledge.\n\n# Included processes\nThis module includes: concrete and energy requirements; transports of radioactive waste and concrete; infrastructure requirement; methan emissions to air; and, seepage water treatement. This describes the operation of a repository for intermediate and long-lived low radioactive waste in the Swiss context.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
